---
description: Atomic placement and import aliases for UI components
globs: src/components/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Placement

- **ui** — shadcn primitives only. Restyle variants to match LetsUpgrade gold, radius, and type.
- **atoms** — one UI concern (Logo, Eyebrow, StarRating).
- **molecules** — a few atoms (ProgramCard, PhoneField, StageStrip).
- **organisms** — a page section (SiteHeader, Hero, ModulePlayer).

If a component needs several files, use a folder named after that component. Do not bucket by route (`organisms/home/`).

# Imports

```js
import { Button } from "@/ui/button"
import Logo from "@/atoms/logo"
import ProgramCard from "@/molecules/program-card"
import SiteHeader from "@/organisms/site-header"
```

Use Tailwind on the element. Do not add CSS modules or ported class names from `style.css`.
